        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2711] If EVCC uses the elliptic curve corresponding to signature algorithm specified by [V2G20-2319], the EVCC shall additionally support X448 as specified by IETF RFC 7748 for calculation of the ECDHE secret and key-derivation for the decryption of encrypted information like private keys.",
